cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use SMART in published work, please cite both the primary
  publication (preferred-citation) and this software repository.
title: "SMART — Simplified Mass Ablation and Relocation Treatment for pellet injection"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-05-22
abstract: >-
  SMART is an IMAS actor and standalone Fortran code implementing a
  reduced-physics model of high-field-side / low-field-side pellet
  injection into a tokamak plasma. It couples a Kuteev/Parks pellet
  ablation model to a Strauss-style post-ablation mass relocation
  treatment along the magnetic field, following Polevoi & Shimada
  (PPCF 43, 2001, 1525).
license: LGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/iterorganization/smart"
keywords:
  - tokamak
  - ITER
  - pellet injection
  - plasma fuelling
  - IMAS
  - integrated modelling
